# Design

- Premium calm technical UI; strong hierarchy and typography.
- Prohibit: AI dashboards, gradient/glass/glow spam, random cards, decorative motion.
- Follow `docs/design-system.md`.
- After UI changes, run skill `design-taste` (inspect → critique → iterate).
- Visually inspect the running app before declaring done.
